incidence equation is

$$
Te_v=a_v e_v+T_{wv}e_w+\sum_{z\sim v,\ z\ne w}T_{zv}e_z.
\tag{77.11}
$$

All terms except $a_v$ and the positive $T_{wv}$ are already represented by
